# Next.js on Netlify: do NOT SPA-fallback static public assets.
# A catch-all /* → /index.html was rewriting or shadowing /demos/*.png in the
# deployed (Netlify) environment while local `next dev` still served them fine.

# Explicit static demo screenshots
/demos/*  200

# Let Next.js static chunks and assets be served (do not rewrite to index.html)
/_next/*  200
